OL,3,AHouthis say they targeted Saudi capital
OL,4,Awith ballistic missiles
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran-backed Houthi militants in Yemen
OL,7,Fsay they carried out drone and
OL,8,Fballistic missile attacks on the Saudi
OL,9,Fcapital Riyadh, as well as energy sites
OL,10,Fon the country's Red Sea coast.
OL,12,FSaudi authorities said they intercepted
OL,13,Fand destroyed a ballistic missile fired
OL,14,Fat Riyadh on Saturday, without
OL,15,Fconfirming any further strikes or
OL,16,Fcausalities.
OL,18,FEarlier, a column of black smoke was
OL,19,Fseen rising from fuel tanks near the
OL,20,FSaudi capital's international airport,
OL,21,Fwhere flights were disrupted
OL,22,Ftemporarily on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
