OL,3,AOur head teacher was an abuser. We
OL,4,Ajoined forces to get justice - now
OL,5,Awe're married
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: This story contains details of
OL,8,Fsexual assault
OL,10,FThe voice on the end of the phone made
OL,11,FYusron Azzahidi's stomach lurch. He had
OL,12,Frung his sister's number after she had
OL,13,Ftexted, urgently asking him to call.
OL,14,FBut this was not her on the line - it
OL,15,Fwas Yusron's former head teacher. He
OL,16,Fwas in Yusron's family home.
OL,18,F"I knew. I knew exactly what he wanted
OL,19,Fto talk about," Yusron says.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
